# Full large PBO originals are kept outside Client after split; never commit accidental backups
*_backup*/
PBO_BACKUP*/
*.pbo.backup*
*.pbo.bak*

# Large PBOs (>95MB) are stored as .part* files in the repo.
# The full PBO files must NOT be committed because GitHub rejects files >100MB.
# The launcher downloads the .part* files and reconstructs the full PBO locally.
